          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.84,
          "end": 14.46,
          "en": "So the card, I mean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.98,
          "end": 20.69,
          "en": "For this, we can start by adding two new buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.67,
