          "en": "Delete first and delete last.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.17,
          "end": 31.72,
          "en": "And of course, we now need some functions that actually help us with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.11,
