          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.3,
          "end": 46.33,
          "en": "Hook these functions up to click listeners on the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46.33,
          "end": 54.91,
          "en": "So here we have onClick and then we have delete first and for the second button unsurprisingly, we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.91,
          "end": 57.76,
          "en": "got delete last like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 58,
          "end": 60.94,
          "en": "Now what should happen in these functions for delete?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 60.94,
          "end": 68.08,
          "en": "First I'll set created contacts equal to created contacts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 69.02,
          "end": 69.77,
          "en": "Slice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 69.77,
          "end": 77.96000000000001,
          "en": "One slice is a built in method in JavaScript, which essentially returns a new array and it starts at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 77.96000000000001,
          "end": 78.77,
          "en": "this position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 78.77,
          "end": 85.34,
          "en": "So it takes created contacts, starts at index one, which is the second element and gives us well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 85.37,
          "end": 89.9,
          "en": "the whole array starting at index one, it essentially drops the first element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 89.9,
          "end": 98.84,
          "en": "Therefore for delete last, I can set created contacts equal created contacts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 99.59,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "Slice zero minus one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 102.5,
          "end": 109.34,
          "en": "This is also using slice, but this essentially tells JavaScript start at the first element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 109.37,
          "end": 114.22999999999999,
          "en": "Give me the whole array up to well minus one means the.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 115.39,
          "end": 117.7,
          "en": "Element before the last element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 118.06,
          "end": 124.72,
          "en": "So created context is updated and therefore we should be able to delete some elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 124.9,
          "end": 130.17,
          "en": "Now let's go back and let's add a card here, Max.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 130.18,
          "end": 134.17,
          "en": "Then let's add Max two so that we can see a difference in the cards.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 134.17,
          "end": 137.05,
          "en": "And let's add Max three here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 137.05,
          "end": 138.79,
          "en": "So we get three elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 139.39,
          "end": 140.56,
          "en": "Now let's delete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 140.56,
          "end": 142.9,
          "en": "The first seems to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 143.14,
          "end": 144.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now let's delete the last.",
